WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.233
Okay,

00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:10.133
a number series!

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:10.767
Two,

00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:11.367
three,

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:12.000
five,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.633
eight,

00:00:12.633 --> 00:00:13.267
thirteen,

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:14.533
and then...

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:16.433
what comes next?

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:17.067
A.

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:17.700
Eighteen,

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:18.333
B.

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:18.933
Twenty,

00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:19.567
C.

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:20.200
Twenty-one,

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.467
or D.

00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:22.100
Twenty-six?

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.367
Five seconds!

00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:30.333
TIME'S UP!

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.533
The answer is...

00:00:32.533 --> 00:00:33.033
C,

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:33.567
twenty-one!

00:00:33.567 --> 00:00:36.600
Add the two numbers before it:

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.167
eight plus thirteen is twenty-one.

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:41.733
It is the add-the-last-two pattern.

00:00:42.867 --> 00:00:43.267
So,

00:00:43.267 --> 00:00:45.300
are you smart or fart?

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.733
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:47.733 --> 00:00:48.933
find your rank!

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:50.433
So,

00:00:50.433 --> 00:00:51.833
how did you do?

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:53.200
Comment your score below,

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.567
and follow for more!
